[00:06.66] Go east of your dream and farm. Let peace and silence spin your yarn.
[00:18.74] What harm can befall thee in yon wilderness of clove?
[00:43.98] Go on east of ginger trees. Go soft and silent like the breeze.
[00:56.46] With ease be off and wander in yon wilderness of clove.
[01:19.14] Go on past the goldenrods, where fools and angels lose their odds.
